sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant FE as Client
  participant API as Receipt Intake API
  participant C as Cloudinary
  participant R as Redis/BullMQ
  participant W as Receipt Worker
  participant G as Gemini
  participant S as Socket.IO

  U->>FE: Upload receipt image
  FE->>API: POST /transactions/scan-receipt
  API->>API: Validate, compress, hash
  API->>R: Read cache(userId + imageHash)

  alt Valid cache hit
    R-->>API: Cached result
    API-->>FE: 200 cached receipt
  else Cache miss
    API->>C: Upload/reuse deterministic asset
    C-->>API: imageUrl
    API->>R: Add job with stable jobId and imageUrl
    R-->>API: Job accepted or duplicate existing job
    API-->>FE: 202 + stable jobId

    R->>W: Deliver job within concurrency/rate limit
    W->>R: Recheck cache
    alt Cache became valid
      R-->>W: Cached result
      W->>S: receipt:scan-completed
      W-->>R: return skipped
    else Still missing
      W->>C: Download bounded image
      C-->>W: Image bytes
      W->>G: Extract receipt data
      alt Permanent non-receipt
        G--xW: NonReceiptImageError
        W->>S: receipt:scan-failed
        W--xR: UnrecoverableError
      else Transient provider failure
        G--xW: 429/503/timeout
        W--xR: throw retryable Error
        R->>R: Backoff and retry
      else Success
        G-->>W: Valid receipt data
        W->>R: Write result cache
        W->>S: receipt:scan-completed
        W-->>R: return succeeded
      end
    end
  end

  opt Client reloads or misses socket
    FE->>API: GET /transactions/scan-receipt/:jobId
    API->>R: Read owned job state/cache
    API-->>FE: waiting/active/completed/failed
  end
